@startuml
title Sequence — sửa, approve, export
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #405670
hide footbox
participant "Operator" as user
participant "Review UI" as ui
participant "API" as api
participant "Review service" as review
participant "Validation" as rules
participant "PostgreSQL" as db
participant "Exporter" as export
user -> ui : Edit fields/items; confirm source
ui -> api : PATCH review(base_revision, expected_version)
api -> review : authorized edit(payload, reason)
review -> rules : schema + normalization + semantic checks
alt Payload valid and head/version current
review -> db : TX: append revision + CAS head + audit
api --> ui : 201 new revision / version / issues
else Stale version or invalid payload
api --> ui : 409 conflict or 422 validation; preserve local edits
end
user -> ui : Review all fields; acknowledge warnings
ui -> api : POST approve(revision_id, expected_version)
api -> review : approve snapshot
review -> rules : revalidate current payload; approval policy
alt No blockers; current head; warnings acknowledged
review -> db : TX: approval + version CAS + audit
api --> ui : 201 approval
else Changed head / blocking issue / missing confirmation
api --> ui : 409 precondition / 422 invalid request
end
ui -> api : POST export(explicit revision_id)
api -> export : export_approved_revision
export -> db : load immutable payload + approval
export -> export : serialize deterministic JSON; hash
export -> db : record artifact keyed by revision/format/version
api --> ui : artifact/download; repeated export same bytes
note over review,db
Rerun is a separate candidate. Save/adopt after approval creates a new draft; old approved export remains tied to old revision.
end note
legend bottom
Một payload revision bất biến; save/approve cạnh tranh dùng CAS; exporter không đọc latest prediction.
endlegend
@enduml
